      "id": "890bf1fb-6ac1-4685-b343-db2c83bbad58",
      "name": "licenses",
      "description": {
        "content": "A license entitles the VAST Cluster operator to an amount of storage capacity for a given period from a given start time. Licenses can be aggregated to increase the licensed capacity. Operating a VAST Cluster requires an installed license. An active valid license entitles the owner to new software releases, service packs and support.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
